meta {
  name: 02_Reject
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Scenario: A person rejects a consent request

    Given the enterprise has created a consent request for the person
    When the person rejects the request
    Then the enterprise reads the request with status Rejected
    And the rejected request can no longer be accepted
    And the rejected request cannot be revoked
    And the Maskinporten lookup reports the consent as not accepted

  The request cannot be deleted. Rejecting it leaves it in a final state.
}
